Purpose and compatibility
-------------------------
The upstream project remains the date-only compatibility baseline. Tasks
Datetime preserves that workflow while adding optional time-of-day and seconds
precision for users who need it in real task-planning scenarios. It is not an
official replacement for the upstream plugin.

